sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Worker A
    participant Store as PersistenceABC
    participant B as Worker B

    A->>Store: acquire(scope, owner, lease)
    Store-->>A: claim (fencing token 7)
    B->>Store: acquire(scope, owner, lease)
    Store-->>B: SessionConflictError
    A->>Store: save(state, expected_revision=3, claim)
    Store-->>A: revision 4
    Note over A: Process stops before release
    Note over Store: Lease expires
    B->>Store: acquire(scope, owner, lease)
    Store-->>B: claim (fencing token 8)
    A->>Store: save(state, expected_revision=4, stale claim)
    Store-->>A: SessionConflictError (claim superseded)
    B->>Store: load(scope)
    Store-->>B: revision 4 with pending audit or interaction marker
    Note over B: Retry pending audit with the same IDs.<br/>A dispatched interaction is never replayed.<br/>Resume with an explicit response.
    B->>Store: release(scope, claim)
